cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the accompanying data, please cite the paper below."
title: "GNN-Spatial-Strain-SHM: Graph Neural Networks for strain-based SHM of composite panels"
abstract: >-
  Code accompanying "Graph neural networks for SHM: exploiting spatial
  interdependencies of strain data for diagnostics and prognostics".
  Implements the GENEA (GENConv with Edge Attributes) model, the
  load-decoupled Health Indicator, and the Leave-One-Panel-Out
  cross-validation protocol used in the paper.
type: software
